[00:00.00]Grandma, I am making bubbles!|奶奶，我在做泡泡！
[00:06.04]Oops!|哎呀！
[00:08.46]Let's make some together.|我们一起做吧。
[00:11.76]We need warm water,|我们需要温水，
[00:14.98]washing powder, and sugar.|洗衣粉，还有糖。
[00:18.18]Sugar?|糖？
[00:19.10]Yes, it makes them strong.|对，这样泡泡才结实。
[00:22.28]Stir, stir, stir!|搅一搅，搅一搅！
[00:24.76]Oh no!|哎呀！
[00:26.22]Stir slowly, baby.|慢慢搅，宝贝。
[00:30.00]Look, it's so many soap bubbles!|你看，好多肥皂泡！
[00:36.60]Very good!|真棒！
[00:38.56]Pop, pop, pop, pop, pop!|啪、啪、啪、啪、啪！
[00:41.42]Now, watch this. A hanger.|现在看这个——一个衣架。
[00:45.08]A hanger?|衣架？
[00:48.14]Yes, for a giant bubble.|对，用来吹一个巨型泡泡。
[00:52.74]Wow! It is flying!|哇！它飞起来了！
[00:56.32]Run, baby, run!|快跑，宝贝，快跑！
[00:58.18]It is going to the sky!|它要飞到天上去了！
[01:02.26]The bubbles are so beautiful.|泡泡真漂亮。
[01:05.24]Yes, just like a dream.|是啊，就像做梦一样。
[01:09.44]I love you, Grandma.|我爱你，奶奶。
